OL,5,G0000 Asian Network Trending
OL,6,     FFor generations, many South Asians
OL,7,     Fexpected to live with their
OL,8,     Fparents until marriage. But with
OL,9,     Fhouse prices and rent rising, what
OL,10,     Fdoes living with mum and dad look
OL,11,     Flike in 2026?
OL,12,G0100 Asian Network Evenings with Saima
OL,13,     FSaima gets you moving out of work
OL,14,     Fmode and ready for the evening -
OL,15,     Fwhether you're cooking, getting
OL,16,     Fready to hit the gym or just
OL,17,     Fchilling at home!
